{%- comment -%}
  theinmag-membership-hero
  Stage 2c rebuild - Pangaia/Guava/Alessi-style two-column sticky-scroll
  PDP for /products/membership. Absorbs the Stage 2b form section so all
  variant logic, line item properties, and Starting Issue widget machinery
  live here in one comprehensive hero.

  Layout:
    Mobile (<750px): single column - thumbs hidden, photo stack, then widget.
    Desktop (>=750px): two columns. Left = thumb strip + 4 square photos
    stacked. Right = info widget with position: sticky so it stays pinned
    while the user scrolls through the photos. Right column releases when
    its content runs out and both columns share scroll past that point.

  Variant Format selector swaps the TOP photo on click (Print / Digital /
  Combo). The 3 photos below stay constant.

  Right column stack:
    1. Judge.me preview badge
    2. Product title (H1)
    3. "Never miss an issue" tagline
    4. Price
    5. Format pills (coral)
    6. Length pills (coral)
    7. Starting Issue stacked tiles (coral)
    8. Add to Cart (yellow sticker)
    9. Trust microcopy
    10. Accordions: What's included, What ages?, Shipping, Cancel anytime (Rolling only)
    11. Wait-time post-add tile

  Locked random background pulled from the 3-image pool via the
  theinmag-section-bg snippet (sitewide pattern - same snippet works
  for every shop section once we extend the pool).

  Spec lives in this conversation; consolidates Stage 2a plumbing +
  Stage 2b extensions + Stage 2c overhaul.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign current_issue = shop.metafields.theinmag.current_issue_number.value | default: 'Mag09'
  assign print_in_stock = shop.metafields.theinmag.current_issue_print_in_stock.value
  assign next_release_value = shop.metafields.theinmag.next_release_date.value
  assign next_release_formatted = next_release_value | date: '%-d %B %Y'

  assign current_num_str = current_issue | remove: 'Mag'
  assign current_num = current_num_str | times: 1
  assign next_num = current_num | plus: 1
  if next_num < 10
    assign next_issue = 'Mag0' | append: next_num
  else
    assign next_issue = 'Mag' | append: next_num
  endif

  assign first_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant

  if print_in_stock
    assign print_stock_attr = 'true'
  else
    assign print_stock_attr = 'false'
  endif

  assign hero_print = 'membership-hero-print.jpg' | asset_url
  assign hero_digital = 'membership-hero-digital.jpg' | asset_url
  assign hero_combo = 'membership-hero-combo.jpg' | asset_url

  comment
    Flick-through video filename pattern: mag{NN}-02-flick-through1.mp4
    Bound to the shop-level current_issue_number metafield so the slot
    auto-rolls to the new mag at each release (Stage 14 trigger). If a
    matching file is not uploaded, the video tag's `poster` fallback or
    a manual file-name update via section setting is the remediation.
  endcomment
  assign flick_through_filename = 'mag' | append: current_num_str | append: '-02-flick-through1.mp4'
  assign flick_through_src = flick_through_filename | asset_url
  assign three_times_year_src = 'trust-overlay-three-times-year.jpg' | asset_url
  assign sustainable_src = 'trust-overlay-sustainable.jpg' | asset_url

  assign tagline = section.settings.tagline | default: 'Inspiring creative kids.'
  assign section_style = '--tmh-pt: ' | append: section.settings.padding_top | append: 'px; --tmh-pb: ' | append: section.settings.padding_bottom | append: 'px;'
-%}

<section
  class="theinmag-membership-hero"
  data-theinmag-membership-form
  data-current-issue="{{ current_issue }}"
  data-next-issue="{{ next_issue }}"
  data-print-in-stock="{{ print_stock_attr }}"
  data-hero-print="{{ hero_print }}"
  data-hero-digital="{{ hero_digital }}"
  data-hero-combo="{{ hero_combo }}"
  aria-labelledby="theinmag-membership-hero-heading"
  style="{{ section_style }}"
>
  {%- comment -%}
    Patterned bg sits at very low opacity here - the hero already
    carries photo mosaic + widget + variant pills, so a strong bg
    competes for attention. 0.2 keeps the dots present-but-quiet
    behind the cream cards, matching Ryan's "very very subtle" call
    on 2026-05-12.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {% render 'theinmag-section-bg', opacity: 0.2 %}

  <div class="theinmag-membership-hero__inner">

    {%- comment -%} LEFT: thumb strip + photo stack {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="theinmag-membership-hero__photos">

      {%- comment -%}
        Thumb strip + photo stack: position 0 is the variant-swap (Format-driven).
        Positions 1-3 are picked by JS from the pool below per page load - 8 trust
        overlay JPGs plus 3 product photos. Membership-specifics (three-times-year,
        gift-giving, nevermissout) get priority-weighting in JS so at least one
        always lands. Pool items render hidden; JS reveals 3 + rebuilds thumb-jump
        indexes to match. No-JS users see only the variant-swap photo and its thumb.
      {%- endcomment -%}

      {%- comment -%}
        Mosaic layout (desktop): three rows.
          Row 1: kids-with-mag (left) + variant-swap (right, next to widget) - 2 squares
          Row 2: 3 random trust overlays picked by JS from the 8-item pool - 3 squares
          Row 3: inside-spread (left) + letterbox (right) - 2 squares
        Mobile: same elements as a horizontal swipe carousel. CSS `order: -1`
        promotes the variant-swap to first so phones see the chosen format
        first as Ryan asked.

        Pool delimiter is `;` (alt texts contain commas like "New mags, three
        times a year." which would otherwise split mid-string). The Row 1-left
        slot (three-times-year) and Row 3-right slot (sustainable) are now fixed
        positions so they're removed from the random pool to avoid duplicates.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign pool_items = 'trust-overlay-gift-giving.jpg|A gift that keeps on giving.|high;trust-overlay-nevermissout.jpg|Letterbox excitement.|high;trust-overlay-ad-free.jpg|100% ad-free.|low;trust-overlay-aussie-kids.jpg|Made by Aussie kids for Aussie kids.|low;trust-overlay-120-pages.jpg|120+ pages of pure creativity.|low;trust-overlay-real-kids.jpg|Real kids. Real names. Real towns.|low' | split: ';' -%}

      <ol class="theinmag-membership-hero__stack" role="list" data-stack>
        {%- comment -%}
          Row 1 LEFT (desktop) / Mobile carousel position 2: locked trust
          overlay "New mags, three times a year."
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <li class="theinmag-membership-hero__photo theinmag-membership-hero__photo--wide" data-photo-index="0">
          <img class="theinmag-membership-hero__image" src="{{ three_times_year_src }}" alt="New mags, three times a year." loading="eager">
        </li>

        {%- comment -%} Row 1 RIGHT / Mobile carousel position 1: variant-swap (Print/Digital/Combo) {%- endcomment -%}
        <li class="theinmag-membership-hero__photo theinmag-membership-hero__photo--wide theinmag-membership-hero__photo--variant" data-photo-locked data-photo-index="1">
          <img class="theinmag-membership-hero__image" data-hero-swap src="{{ hero_print }}" alt="theINmag Membership - the magazine for creative kids." loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
        </li>

        {%- comment -%} Row 2: 3 trust overlays from 6-item pool, JS reveals 3 with priority bias {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- for item in pool_items -%}
          {%- assign parts = item | split: '|' -%}
          {%- assign filename = parts[0] -%}
          {%- assign alt = parts[1] -%}
          {%- assign priority = parts[2] -%}
          <li class="theinmag-membership-hero__photo theinmag-membership-hero__photo--narrow" data-pool-photo data-pool-priority="{{ priority }}" hidden>
            <img class="theinmag-membership-hero__image" src="{{ filename | asset_url }}" alt="{{ alt | escape }}" loading="lazy">
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}

        {%- comment -%}
          Row 3 LEFT: flick-through video of the current mag. Filename is
          constructed from the current_issue_number metafield so the slot
          auto-rolls when a new issue drops. Autoplay muted loop playsinline
          so iOS Safari runs it without user interaction.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <li class="theinmag-membership-hero__photo theinmag-membership-hero__photo--wide theinmag-membership-hero__photo--mobile-second">
          <video
            class="theinmag-membership-hero__image"
            src="{{ flick_through_src }}"
            autoplay
            muted
            loop
            playsinline
            preload="metadata"
            aria-label="A quick flick-through of the latest theINmag issue."
          ></video>
        </li>

        {%- comment -%} Row 3 RIGHT: locked trust overlay "Sustainably printed in Australia" {%- endcomment -%}
        <li class="theinmag-membership-hero__photo theinmag-membership-hero__photo--wide">
          <img class="theinmag-membership-hero__image" src="{{ sustainable_src }}" alt="Sustainably printed in Australia." loading="lazy">
        </li>
      </ol>

      {%- comment -%}
        Mobile carousel dots indicator - sits below the carousel, shows
        position. Hidden on desktop (mosaic is fully visible at once).
        JS reuses the existing thumb-jump handlers via the data-thumb-jump
        attribute, treating dots as a degenerate thumb strip.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <ol class="theinmag-membership-hero__dots" role="list" aria-label="Photo position" data-dots>
        <li><button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__dot is-active" data-thumb-jump="0" aria-label="Photo 1"></button></li>
        <li><button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__dot" data-thumb-jump="1" aria-label="Photo 2"></button></li>
        <li><button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__dot" data-pool-dot data-thumb-jump="" aria-label="Photo 3" hidden></button></li>
        <li><button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__dot" data-pool-dot data-thumb-jump="" aria-label="Photo 4" hidden></button></li>
        <li><button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__dot" data-pool-dot data-thumb-jump="" aria-label="Photo 5" hidden></button></li>
        <li><button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__dot" data-pool-dot data-thumb-jump="" aria-label="Photo 6" hidden></button></li>
        <li><button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__dot" data-pool-dot data-thumb-jump="" aria-label="Photo 7" hidden></button></li>
        <li><button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__dot" data-pool-dot data-thumb-jump="" aria-label="Photo 8" hidden></button></li>
        <li><button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__dot" data-thumb-jump="" aria-label="Photo (flick-through video)"></button></li>
        <li><button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__dot" data-thumb-jump="" aria-label="Photo (sustainable)"></button></li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} RIGHT: sticky info widget {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="theinmag-membership-hero__widget" data-widget>

      {%- comment -%}
        Wrap the brand-pun IN in <span class="theinmag-in"> for sitewide
        emphasis treatment (Post Regular renders the IN glyphs slightly
        larger per the design rule). Targets "theINmag" specifically so
        we don't catch unrelated IN substrings (PRINTING, INTERESTING, etc).
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign title_html = product.title | replace: 'theINmag', 'the<span class="theinmag-in">IN</span>mag' -%}
      <h1 id="theinmag-membership-hero-heading" class="theinmag-membership-hero__title">{{ title_html }}</h1>

      {%- comment -%}
        Rating slot sits BETWEEN title and tagline so there's no dead space
        above the H1 (pre-Judge.me-load the Judge.me badge slot collapses to
        zero height). Wrapped in an anchor that scrolls to the reviews section
        when clicked. JS handles header-offset-aware smooth scroll.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <a href="#theinmag-membership-reviews-heading" class="theinmag-membership-hero__rating-link" data-rating-jump aria-label="Read customer reviews">
        <div class="jdgm-prev-badge" data-id="{{ product.id }}" data-template="badge"></div>
      </a>

      {%- if tagline != blank -%}
        <p class="theinmag-membership-hero__tagline">{{ tagline }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="theinmag-membership-hero__price" data-price-display>{{ first_variant.price | money }}</div>
      <p class="theinmag-membership-hero__shipping-note" data-shipping-note hidden>Shipping included</p>

      <form
        action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}"
        method="post"
        enctype="multipart/form-data"
        class="theinmag-membership-hero__form"
        data-membership-form
      >
        <input type="hidden" name="id" data-variant-id-input value="{{ first_variant.id }}">
        <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
        <input type="hidden" name="properties[_starting_mag]" data-prop-starting-mag value="{{ current_issue }}">
        <input type="hidden" name="properties[_remaining_after_first]" data-prop-remaining value="3">
        <input type="hidden" name="properties[_mags_included]" data-prop-mags-included value="">

        <fieldset class="theinmag-membership-hero__fieldset">
          <legend class="theinmag-membership-hero__legend">Format</legend>
          <div class="theinmag-membership-hero__pills" role="radiogroup" data-option-name="format">
            <button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__pill" data-value="Print" aria-pressed="true">Print</button>
            <button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__pill" data-value="Digital" aria-pressed="false">Digital</button>
            <button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__pill" data-value="Combo" aria-pressed="false">Combo</button>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="theinmag-membership-hero__fieldset">
          <legend class="theinmag-membership-hero__legend">Length</legend>
          <div class="theinmag-membership-hero__pills" role="radiogroup" data-option-name="length">
            <button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__pill" data-value="4-Issue" aria-pressed="true">4-Issue</button>
            <button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__pill" data-value="8-Issue" aria-pressed="false">8-Issue</button>
            <button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__pill" data-value="Rolling" aria-pressed="false">Rolling</button>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="theinmag-membership-hero__fieldset">
          <legend class="theinmag-membership-hero__legend">Starting issue</legend>
          <div class="theinmag-membership-hero__starting" role="radiogroup" data-option-name="starting">
            <button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__start-tile" data-value="current" data-requires-print-stock="true" aria-pressed="true">
              <span class="theinmag-membership-hero__start-title">Start with the current issue</span>
              <span class="theinmag-membership-hero__start-sub">{{ current_issue }}{% if print_in_stock %} - in stock now{% endif %}</span>
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__start-tile" data-value="next" aria-pressed="false">
              <span class="theinmag-membership-hero__start-title">Start with the next issue</span>
              <span class="theinmag-membership-hero__start-sub">{{ next_issue }} - drops {{ next_release_formatted }}</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <button type="submit" class="theinmag-membership-hero__cta" data-primary-cta>Add to cart</button>

        <p class="theinmag-membership-hero__microcopy">
          Free shipping over $40 - Sustainably printed in Australia - 120+ pages, zero ads
        </p>
      </form>

      <ul class="theinmag-membership-hero__accordions" role="list">

        <li class="theinmag-membership-hero__accordion" data-accordion>
          <h3 class="theinmag-membership-hero__acc-q">
            <button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__acc-trigger" data-acc-trigger aria-expanded="false">
              <span>What's included</span>
              <span class="theinmag-membership-hero__acc-caret" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
          </h3>
          <div class="theinmag-membership-hero__acc-panel" data-acc-panel data-open="false">
            <p>Your chosen format (Print, Digital, or Combo) of every issue across the Membership length. First-dibs on each and every mag drop. Oh yeah - and endless inspiration.</p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="theinmag-membership-hero__accordion" data-accordion>
          <h3 class="theinmag-membership-hero__acc-q">
            <button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__acc-trigger" data-acc-trigger aria-expanded="false">
              <span>What ages is this magazine for?</span>
              <span class="theinmag-membership-hero__acc-caret" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
          </h3>
          <div class="theinmag-membership-hero__acc-panel" data-acc-panel data-open="false">
            <p>Designed for kids aged 5-13, though lately we've had submissions from kids up to 16. How exciting. Literally enjoyed by the whole family - the puzzles, jokes, art, and short comics pull in younger siblings, the longer reads and creator interviews keep older kids hooked, and parents usually end up reading along too.</p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="theinmag-membership-hero__accordion" data-accordion>
          <h3 class="theinmag-membership-hero__acc-q">
            <button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__acc-trigger" data-acc-trigger aria-expanded="false">
              <span>Shipping and delivery</span>
              <span class="theinmag-membership-hero__acc-caret" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
          </h3>
          <div class="theinmag-membership-hero__acc-panel" data-acc-panel data-open="false">
            <p>Print mags ship within three business days from order. Free shipping over $40 - not a problem for members. Digital lands in your inbox the day each issue drops. Releases hit mid February, mid June, and mid October.</p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="theinmag-membership-hero__accordion" data-accordion data-rolling-only hidden>
          <h3 class="theinmag-membership-hero__acc-q">
            <button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__acc-trigger" data-acc-trigger aria-expanded="false">
              <span>Can I cancel anytime?</span>
              <span class="theinmag-membership-hero__acc-caret" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
          </h3>
          <div class="theinmag-membership-hero__acc-panel" data-acc-panel data-open="false">
            <p>Yes - two-click cancel from your account on theinmag.com.au. No emails, no phone calls, no "90-day notice" nonsense. Any issue already charged still ships; renewals stop from the next drop.</p>
          </div>
        </li>

      </ul>

      <aside class="theinmag-membership-hero__post-add" aria-label="Shipping and digital alternative" data-post-add-tile hidden>
        <p>Grabbing a printed mag? It's about to start its Aussie road trip to your house 🚐💨 - up to three business days to ship. Want something to flick through tonight? Upgrade to Combo above and the digital lands in your inbox in about four minutes.</p>
      </aside>

    </div>
  </div>

  <script type="application/json" data-membership-variants>
    [
      {%- for v in product.variants -%}
        {"id": {{ v.id }}, "option1": {{ v.option1 | json }}, "option2": {{ v.option2 | json }}, "price": {{ v.price }}, "available": {{ v.available }}}{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    ]
  </script>

</section>

{%- comment -%}
  Floating order-summary card. Rendered as a sibling of the hero
  section (not a child) so it escapes the hero's stacking context
  (isolation: isolate) and stays on top of every section that comes
  after the hero. position: fixed + viewport-level stacking context
  = always-on-top while scrolling the rest of the PDP.

  Same cream-card register as the widget so it reads as "the same
  widget in miniature" - clearly the user's order. Shown by JS via
  the existing data-back-to-order hook when the widget's bottom
  scrolls off viewport top. Two interaction targets inside: (1) the
  body acts as a back-to-widget tap and (2) the CTA submits the
  form's currently-selected variant to cart. Reuses the form's
  variant data + price machinery via update() in theinmag-membership-form.js.
{%- endcomment -%}
<aside class="theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart" data-back-to-order data-floating-cart data-show="false" aria-label="Your order summary">
  <div class="theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart-card">
    <button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart-tap" data-floating-cart-tap aria-label="Back to the selectors">
      <span class="theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart-eyebrow">your order</span>
      <span class="theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart-summary" data-floating-cart-summary>4-Issue Print</span>
      <span class="theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart-issue" data-floating-cart-issue>Start with {{ current_issue }}</span>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart-cta" data-floating-cart-cta aria-label="Add this Membership to cart">
      <span>Add to cart</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">-</span>
      <span data-floating-cart-cta-price>{{ first_variant.price | money }}</span>
    </button>
  </div>
</aside>

<script src="{{ 'theinmag-membership-form.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{% stylesheet %}
  .theinmag-membership-hero {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    padding: var(--tmh-pt, 56px) var(--space-lg) var(--tmh-pb, 56px);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .theinmag-membership-hero__inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
  }

  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .theinmag-membership-hero__inner {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-2xl);
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  /* ---------- LEFT column ---------- */

  /* Photo column is a cream card matching the widget's surface colour with
     SHARP corners (Ryan's spec - widget keeps its rounded corners as a
     visual distinction). Big glow lifts both cards off the patterned bg. */
  .theinmag-membership-hero__photos {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    width: 100%;
    background-color: rgba(251, 246, 234, 0.94);
    padding: var(--space-sm);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(42, 31, 61, 0.22);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  }

  /* Photo stack - mobile is a horizontal swipe carousel, desktop is a 6-col
     grid mosaic with 3 rows: 2 wide squares, 3 narrow squares, 2 wide squares. */
  .theinmag-membership-hero__stack {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    /* Mobile: horizontal scroll-snap carousel. Variant-swap promoted to first
       via CSS `order` (Ryan's spec - phones see the chosen format first). */
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    margin: 0 calc(-1 * var(--space-lg));
    padding: 0 var(--space-lg);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__stack::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }

  /* Mobile: each photo takes ~85% viewport width, snap aligns to start. */
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .theinmag-membership-hero__photo {
      flex: 0 0 85%;
      scroll-snap-align: start;
    }
    /* Variant-swap first on mobile per Ryan: "that first one will always be
       the one they select so printed digital or combo image." Flick-through
       video sits second so the kid sees motion before the trust overlays. */
    .theinmag-membership-hero__photo--variant { order: -2; }
    .theinmag-membership-hero__photo--mobile-second { order: -1; }

    /* Photos card spans the full viewport on mobile - Ryan: the slider
       was breaking out of the cream card, extend the card edge-to-edge
       instead so the carousel sits inside its own surface. */
    .theinmag-membership-hero__photos {
      margin-left: calc(-1 * var(--space-lg));
      margin-right: calc(-1 * var(--space-lg));
      width: calc(100% + (2 * var(--space-lg)));
    }
  }

  /* Desktop: 6-col mosaic. Wide squares span 3 cols, narrow span 2.
     Uniform small gap so the patterned bg shows through between every
     photo, photos keep their soft shadow for the lifted-card feel. */
  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .theinmag-membership-hero__stack {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-sm);
      overflow: visible;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .theinmag-membership-hero__photo--wide { grid-column: span 3; }
    .theinmag-membership-hero__photo--narrow { grid-column: span 2; }
  }

  /* Sharp-edged square photo card. Soft shadow keeps the lifted feel
     even without rounded corners. Bg shows through gaps between photos. */
  /* Photos sit inside the card wrapper - the card carries the lifted glow,
     individual photos just need clean edges and a soft background. */
  .theinmag-membership-hero__photo {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    border-radius: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: var(--color-cream);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__photo[hidden] { display: none; }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__image {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  /* Mobile dots indicator - sits below the carousel, shows position. Hidden
     on desktop (mosaic is fully visible). The existing thumb-jump JS handler
     treats these as a degenerate thumb strip. */
  .theinmag-membership-hero__dots {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0;
    margin: var(--space-sm) 0 0;
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__dots li { margin: 0; }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background: rgba(42, 31, 61, 0.25);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background var(--transition-standard), transform var(--transition-standard);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__dot.is-active {
    background: var(--color-soft-pink);
    transform: scale(1.4);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__dot[hidden] { display: none; }
  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .theinmag-membership-hero__dots { display: none; }
  }

  /* ---------- RIGHT column (sticky widget) ---------- */

  /* Cream card with subtle transparency over the patterned bg. Backdrop
     blur softens the bg pattern behind the widget for legibility. */
  .theinmag-membership-hero__widget {
    background-color: rgba(251, 246, 234, 0.94);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    /* Tight top padding kills dead space above the title; bottom keeps
       breathing room beneath the post-add tile. Glow matches the photos
       card so both lift off the patterned bg with the same weight. */
    padding: var(--space-xs) var(--space-lg) var(--space-lg);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(42, 31, 61, 0.22);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  }

  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .theinmag-membership-hero__widget {
      /* Widget starts aligned with photos top (align-self: start). Both
         columns scroll naturally with the page until the widget's bottom
         would otherwise exit viewport - sticky-bottom then pins it at
         viewport bottom. Photos keep scrolling on the left until their
         bottom catches up at section end, both release simultaneously.
         Ryan: "they move together at the start but the widget stops
         before the photos... until both bottoms line up". */
      position: sticky;
      bottom: 0;
      align-self: start;
      padding: var(--space-xs) var(--space-lg) var(--space-lg);
    }
  }

  /* Rating link wraps the Judge.me badge - clickable scroll-jump to reviews
     section. Slot has zero min-height so pre-Judge.me-load it collapses;
     once populated, Judge.me's own internal spacing applies. */
  .theinmag-membership-hero__rating-link {
    display: block;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-xs);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__rating-link .jdgm-prev-badge { display: block; cursor: pointer; }

  .theinmag-membership-hero__title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    margin: 0 0 2px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Editorial benefit line under title. Inky-navy italic - sandy-orange
     read as "red" against the soft pink pills, the pair clashed.
     Centred + sitting tight under the title (Ryan: closer to heading). */
  .theinmag-membership-hero__tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    opacity: 0.78;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .theinmag-membership-hero__price {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 26px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-xs);
  }

  /* Shipping-included note appears under the price for Rolling Print + Rolling
     Combo - the spec bakes shipping into the Rolling variant price, so flag it
     up-front before the customer hits checkout. JS toggles `hidden`. */
  .theinmag-membership-hero__shipping-note {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--color-sage-dark);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__shipping-note[hidden] { display: none; }

  .theinmag-membership-hero__form { display: block; }

  .theinmag-membership-hero__fieldset {
    border: 0;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
  }

  .theinmag-membership-hero__legend {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-xs);
    opacity: 0.78;
  }

  /* Soft-pink pill toggles - white default, pink border, pink fill on
     selection. The pink (--color-soft-pink, sampled from the header wordmark
     backdrop) reads warmer and less aggressive than the dark coral. Selected
     state keeps inky-navy text so we hold WCAG AA contrast on the pink fill. */
  .theinmag-membership-hero__pills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .theinmag-membership-hero__pill {
    /* flex: 1 1 0 (NOT 1 1 auto) so all three pills divide the row
       equally regardless of label width - "4-Issue" is shorter than
       "8-Issue"/"Rolling" so auto sizes give unequal widths. */
    flex: 1 1 0;
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 40px;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-soft-pink);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background var(--transition-standard), color var(--transition-standard);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__pill:hover { background: rgba(247, 160, 146, 0.18); }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__pill[aria-pressed='true'] {
    background: var(--color-soft-pink);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__pill[hidden] { display: none; }

  /* Starting issue tiles - stacked vertically per Ryan's preference (reverting
     the earlier side-by-side experiment - the stacked treatment reads cleaner
     and lets the two-line tile content breathe). */
  .theinmag-membership-hero__starting {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__start-tile {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-soft-pink);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 10px 14px;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    transition: background var(--transition-standard), color var(--transition-standard);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__start-tile[aria-pressed='true'] {
    background: var(--color-soft-pink);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__start-tile[hidden] { display: none; }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__start-title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__start-sub { font-weight: 400; font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.85; }

  /* Yellow sticker Add to Cart - locked convention. */
  .theinmag-membership-hero__cta {
    /* Centred, max-width capped so the CTA doesn't stretch across the
       full widget - Ryan's call: bring the edges in, keep the height,
       bump the Post font slightly. */
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 300px;
    margin: var(--space-sm) auto 0;
    background: var(--color-yellow);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 19px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius-button);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-button-yellow);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background var(--transition-standard), color var(--transition-standard), translate var(--transition-standard), box-shadow var(--transition-standard);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__cta:hover {
    background: var(--color-purple-dark);
    color: #ffffff;
    translate: 0 2px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-button-pressed);
  }

  .theinmag-membership-hero__microcopy {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    opacity: 0.78;
    margin: var(--space-sm) 0 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Accordions - small text (Ryan's preference), open one at a time
     pattern handled by the JS. Cancel-anytime accordion has [hidden]
     toggled by JS based on Length=Rolling. */
  .theinmag-membership-hero__accordions {
    list-style: none;
    margin: var(--space-lg) 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(42, 31, 61, 0.12);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__accordion {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(42, 31, 61, 0.12);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__accordion[hidden] { display: none; }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__acc-q { margin: 0; }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__acc-trigger {
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    background: transparent;
    border: 0;
    padding: 10px 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__acc-caret {
    position: relative;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__acc-caret::before,
  .theinmag-membership-hero__acc-caret::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    background: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, opacity 0.2s ease;
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__acc-caret::before {
    top: 50%; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__acc-caret::after {
    left: 50%; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 2px;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__acc-trigger[aria-expanded='true'] .theinmag-membership-hero__acc-caret::after {
    transform: translateX(-50%) scaleY(0);
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__acc-panel {
    max-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height 0.3s ease;
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__acc-panel[data-open='true'] { max-height: 600px; }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__acc-panel p {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 0 var(--space-md);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  /* Wait-time tile - lavender-tinted card below the accordions. */
  .theinmag-membership-hero__post-add {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    background-color: rgba(232, 222, 239, 0.7);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__post-add p {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
  }

  /* Floating order-summary card.
     OUTER (.theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart) handles fixed
     positioning + the slide-in entry transform when data-show flips
     to "true".
     INNER (.theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart-card) holds the
     visible cream-card styling + a ridiculously-subtle continuous
     wobble. Splitting outer/inner stops the slide-in transform
     fighting the wobble rotation (single-element transform can only
     hold one animation at a time without smearing). */
  .theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart {
    position: fixed;
    z-index: 50;
    /* Mobile: bottom-fixed, full-width minus side gutters. */
    left: var(--space-md);
    right: var(--space-md);
    bottom: calc(var(--space-md) + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
    /* Slide-in starts above (desktop) or below (mobile) the final
       resting position. Initial opacity 0 + pointer-events none so
       the hidden card never intercepts clicks. */
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(24px);
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity 0.45s ease, transform 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.4, 0.64, 1);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart[data-show="true"] {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
    pointer-events: auto;
  }

  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart {
      /* Desktop: top-right floating card, well clear of the header. */
      top: clamp(104px, 13vh, 140px);
      right: var(--space-md);
      bottom: auto;
      left: auto;
      width: clamp(220px, 22vw, 260px);
      /* Desktop slides DOWN from above the resting position. */
      transform: translateY(-28px);
    }
    .theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart[data-show="true"] {
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  .theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    background-color: rgba(251, 246, 234, 0.96);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-soft-pink);
    border-radius: 20px;
    /* Deep shadow so the card reads 3D off the page (Ryan's brief). */
    box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(42, 31, 61, 0.28), 0 4px 12px rgba(42, 31, 61, 0.14);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }

  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart-card {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 16px 16px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      /* Ridiculously subtle wobble - tiny rotation + drift, slow loop. */
      animation: theinmag-floating-cart-wobble 5.5s ease-in-out infinite;
      transform-origin: 80% 40%;
    }
  }

  @keyframes theinmag-floating-cart-wobble {
    0%, 100% { transform: rotate(-0.35deg) translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: rotate(0.35deg) translateY(-1.5px); }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart {
      transition: none;
    }
    .theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart-card {
      animation: none;
    }
  }

  .theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart-tap {
    appearance: none;
    background: transparent;
    border: 0;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    text-align: left;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-width: 0;
    color: inherit;
    font-family: inherit;
    transition: opacity var(--transition-hover);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart-tap:hover,
  .theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart-tap:focus-visible {
    opacity: 0.85;
    outline: none;
  }

  .theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart-eyebrow {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-soft-pink);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart-summary {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart-issue {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: rgba(42, 31, 61, 0.7);
  }

  .theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart-cta {
    appearance: none;
    border: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    background: var(--color-soft-pink);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    font-family: inherit;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: background var(--transition-standard), translate var(--transition-standard);
  }
  .theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart-cta:hover,
  .theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart-cta:focus-visible {
    background: var(--color-yellow);
    translate: 0 -1px;
    outline: none;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .theinmag-membership-hero__floating-cart-cta:hover { translate: 0 0; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .theinmag-membership-hero__cta:hover {
      translate: 0 0;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-button-yellow);
    }
    .theinmag-membership-hero__acc-panel { transition: none; }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Membership hero",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "shopify-section theinmag-membership-hero-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Two-column sticky-scroll PDP. Photos left, info widget right. Photos pull from /assets/ filenames membership-hero-print/digital/combo.jpg and membership-photo-1/2/3.jpg. Random background from membership-section-bg_1/2/3.jpg pool."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Copy"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tagline",
      "label": "Tagline (under product title)",
      "default": "Inspiring creative kids."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Spacing"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "label": "Padding top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 128,
      "step": 4,
      "default": 56,
      "unit": "px"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "label": "Padding bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 128,
      "step": 4,
      "default": 56,
      "unit": "px"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "Membership hero" }
  ],
  "enabled_on": {
    "templates": ["product"]
  }
}
{% endschema %}
